<mxPoint x="100" y="2728" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Business rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Only authenticated users can view and update their own profile; common account information is in User.&lt;br&gt;• Student and Senior users use StudentProfile (Senior is a specialized Student, no separate SeniorProfile); Alumni users use AlumniProfile. No new entities, fields or relationships.&lt;br&gt;• Only editable profile fields can change; ordinary updates never change protected account information, credentials or roles.&lt;br&gt;• Registration, login and account deletion are out of scope. Normal HTTPS REST requests only." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2854" width="1000" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>